        "original_id": "9002b4d9-473f-5b43-9f6f-fcc749eddf08",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Air Lituanica, airBaltic\n- Places: Vilnius, Lithuania\n- Organizations: Vilnius Airport, Riga International Airport, Tallinn Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Air Lituanica was a Lithuanian airline headquartered in Vilnius and based at Vilnius Airport.\n- Vilnius Airport is the international airport of Vilnius, the capital of Lithuania, and its codes are IATA VNO and ICAO EYVI.\n- Air Lituanica ceased operations in 2015.\n- airBaltic has its main hub at Riga International Airport and additional bases at Tallinn Airport and Vilnius Airport.",
